// vendor/qrcode.js: QR Code encoder for the engine's Share sheet (Q-52).
// A copy of tools/publish/qr-encode.mjs (CoAuthor's own MIT encoder, checked
// bit-for-bit against the Arase encoder in Q-53a). Loaded only by a dynamic
// import() from src/ui/components/ShareSheet.js, never from the import map.
// Keep the two copies in step when either changes.
//
// Compact QR Code encoder (byte mode, versions 1-40, ECC L/M/Q/H, automatic mask).
// Encodes text as a QR symbol (modules[y][x]); qrSvg() draws it as an SVG string.
//
